><figure><img alt=\"(連環圖)深色衫四眼男多次舉起摺凳，襲擊手持兩隻公仔、正在逃走的光頭漢。(網片截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260525/1135402243403943936517428.png/mKIPUr_0uXONf_yzgbcUhSBpyXotG8UUe7fQdnu30HY\"/><figcaption>(連環圖)深色衫四眼男多次舉起摺凳，襲擊手持兩隻公仔、正在逃走的光頭漢。(網片截圖)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-24T18:18:54.661738+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1399,"images":21,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}